<title>UK: Postipankki sets two bonds of 200 million Fim.</title>
<headline>Postipankki sets two bonds of 200 million Fim.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Postipankki Board of Management has decided to launch two bond issues of 200 million Finnish markka targeted to the public, Postipankki Ltd said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>One bond will mature after three years and the other after six years.  </p>
<p>The nominal value of the three-year bond issue coupon is 3.5 percent and the issue price is variable.</p>
<p>The nominal coupon of the six-year bond issue is 4.75 percent and the issue price is variable.</p>
<p>The subscription period of the two issues is from November 28, 1996 to February 7, 1997.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
